OL,3,AUK's 'dismal' Eurovision song choices
OL,4,Ato be examined by MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's "dismal" record in selecting
OL,7,Fsongs and acts for Eurovision is to be
OL,8,Fscrutinised by MPs.
OL,10,FIn May, Look Mum No Computer came last
OL,11,Fwith one point. In 2023 Mae Muller
OL,12,Ffinished second from bottom and in 2021
OL,13,FJames Newman came last - this time with
OL,14,F"nul points".
OL,16,FThe act that represents the UK is
OL,17,Fselected by the BBC, sometimes with a
OL,18,Frecord label or music management
OL,19,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
